  "decision_rule": "Next, look up OIL-FLTR-001. Then, one tool call per turn, look up the other two SKUs, apply pricing rules separately to each part using customer_account_id 1, the returned category, requested quantity, and order_date 2025-10-23, and create lines 1–3 from the returned pricing. Set backorder_status to allow on each line.",
  "expected_transition": "The immediate next call returns the part ID, category, and list price for OIL-FLTR-001. Subsequent calls produce system-calculated discounts and create all three lines on sales_order_id 11 with quantities 10, 4, and 2.",
  "recovery_check": "After all line creations, call list_sales_order_lines for sales_order_id 11 and confirm exactly three expected SKUs and quantities, system-derived prices/discounts, and backorder_status allow; only then report completion."
}

